### Phase 4 — REST API Deep Dive (GET/POST/PUT/PATCH/DELETE Dispatcher, Validation, CORS, Pagination, Error Handling)
### Click "Send Request" (VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP Client)
### Start server first: .\run.bat
### Note: Using /@@api-employees bypasses Zope's WebDAV handler so PUT/PATCH/DELETE work cleanly!

@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8080

### 1. List with Pagination + Sorting (page 1, size 2, sorted by nameEn)
GET {{baseUrl}}/@@api-employees?page=1&size=2&sort=nameEn&order=asc
Accept: application/json

### 2. Search + Filter (?q=zope&dept=Engineering)
GET {{baseUrl}}/@@api-employees?q=tanaka&dept=Engineering
Accept: application/json

### 3. Get Single Employee (shows version=1 for optimistic locking)
GET {{baseUrl}}/@@api-employees/EMP-0001
Accept: application/json

### 4. Create Employee (201 Created)
POST {{baseUrl}}/@@api-employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "empCode": "EMP-0006",
  "nameEn": "Miyu Nakamura",
  "nameJa": "中村 美優",
  "departmentEn": "QA",
  "role": "QA Lead",
  "email": "m.nakamura@example.co.jp",
  "skills": ["Playwright", "API Testing"]
}

### 5. Validation Error Demo (400 E_VALIDATION with field-level details list)
POST {{baseUrl}}/@@api-employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "empCode": "BAD-CODE",
  "nameEn": "",
  "departmentEn": "UnknownDept",
  "email": "not-an-email"
}

### 6. Full Update via PUT with Optimistic Locking (version: 1 -> becomes version: 2)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/@@api-employees/EMP-0006
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "version": 1,
  "nameEn": "Miyu Nakamura",
  "nameJa": "中村 美優",
  "departmentEn": "Engineering",
  "role": "Senior QA Automation Engineer",
  "email": "m.nakamura@example.co.jp",
  "skills": ["Playwright", "Python", "Zope"]
}

### 7. Optimistic Lock Conflict Demo (sending stale version: 1 -> 409 E_VERSION_CONFLICT!)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/@@api-employees/EMP-0006
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "version": 1,
  "nameEn": "Miyu Nakamura",
  "nameJa": "中村 美優",
  "departmentEn": "Engineering",
  "role": "Stale Update",
  "email": "m.nakamura@example.co.jp"
}

### 8. Partial Update via PATCH (only update role, version becomes 3)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/@@api-employees/EMP-0006
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "QA Manager"
}

### 9. Soft Delete via DELETE (deletedFlg = true)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/@@api-employees/EMP-0006
Accept: application/json

### 10. CORS Preflight Check (OPTIONS -> 204 No Content + Access-Control-Allow-* headers)
OPTIONS {{baseUrl}}/@@api-employees
Origin: http://localhost:4200

### 11. Global 500 JSON Error Handler Demo (?crash=true -> returns clean JSON, never HTML!)
GET {{baseUrl}}/@@api-employees?crash=true
Accept: application/json
